flowchart LR
    Primary[Primary workload] --> Replication[ASR replication]
    Replication --> Recovery[Recovery location]
    Recovery --> Test[Test failover in isolated network]
    Test --> Evidence[Validate app, DNS, identity and data]
    Primary --> Declare{Disaster declared?}
    Declare -->|Yes| Failover[Execute recovery plan]
    Failover --> Business[Restore business service]
    Business --> Failback[Reprotect / failback]
